L000487	$i\omega = 1$, and rest-frame signaling speed
L000488	$w=0$ (blue), $0.5$ (magenta), $0.97$ (red), and $1$ (black dashed). For
L000489	$w=0$, the admissible region collapses to the time--dilation line $i\omega' = 1/\gamma$,
L000490	while for $w=1$ the result reduces to \eqref{theboundoni}, which is the only
L000491	case in which $i\omega'$ may diverge as $v \to 1$.
